              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni abitotomba n'ababubura bagenda bakurikiza irari ryabo, akanwa kabo kavuga amagambo atumbyemo agasuzuguro, bubahira abantu kubakuraho indamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.16",
